OL,3,GNEWSAFormer council leader denies
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former council leader in
OL,7,FLeicestershire has denied sexually
OL,8,Fassaulting a woman.
OL,10,FPhilip Allnatt, from Melton Mowbray,
OL,11,Fappeared at Leicester Magistrates'
OL,12,FCourt on Monday, after being charged
OL,13,Fwith sexual assault and harassment
OL,14,Fwithout violence last month.
OL,16,FWearing a blue suit, tie, trousers,
OL,17,Fsunglasses and using a walking stick,
OL,18,FAllnatt stood only to confirm his name,
OL,19,Faddress and plea during the hearing.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
