OL,3,GNEWSAFormer council leader denies
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 76-year-old pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fthe charge of sexual assault and chose
OL,8,Fto have the case tried at Leicester
OL,9,FCrown Court, according to the Local
OL,10,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS).
